# Variables:
#   $partner (string) - a company name, e.g. Acme
# $partner is a company name and stays in its original form. If your language changes a name’s ending after ‘from’, rephrase the sentence so the name can stay unchanged.
partner-download-language-not-available = Denne nedlastingen av { -brand-name-firefox } fra { $partner } er ikke tilgjengelig på ditt språk. Du kan likevel laste ned { -brand-name-firefox } ved å bruke knappen nedenfor.
# Variables:
#   $partner (string) - a company name, e.g. Acme
# $partner is a company name and stays in its original form. If your language changes a name’s ending after ‘from’, rephrase the sentence so the name can stay unchanged.
partner-download-device-not-available = Denne nedlastingen av { -brand-name-firefox } fra { $partner } er ikke tilgjengelig for enheten din. Du kan likevel laste ned { -brand-name-firefox } ved å bruke knappen nedenfor.
# firefox.com is a web address. Don’t translate it.
partner-download-already-using-firefox = Du bruker allerede { -brand-name-firefox }. Fortsett til firefox.com for å se hva som er nytt.
# firefox.com is a web address. Don’t translate it.
partner-download-continue = Fortsett til firefox.com
# Variables:
#   $partner (string) - a company name, e.g. Acme
# $partner is a company name and stays in its original form. If your language changes a name’s ending after ‘from’, rephrase the sentence so the name can stay unchanged.
